graph TD
    INPUT[Consumer Inputs] --> MET[ConsumerMetrics]
    MET --> SCORE[ConsumerScoreEngine]
    SCORE --> PILLAR[Pillars: Quality / Growth / Risk / Profitability / CapitalEfficiency / Valuation]
    PILLAR --> COMP[Composite Score]
    COMP --> DEC[ConsumerDecision]
    DEC --> VERDICT[Verdict + Overrides]
    DEC --> EVID[ConsumerEvidence]
    EVID --> SNAP[Snapshot + Replay]
    COMP --> ONTO[Ontology Registration]
    ONTO --> CSIP[CSIP / Portfolio Intelligence]
